  // Screen 15 - the Shop (mockups 15 Cards, 20 Backgrounds, 21 Tables; designer's spec
  // shop-drawer-and-tables-prompts.md). Rects are mockup pixels on 15-card-styles.png: the shared
  // shell (back disc, title block, panel, primary button, the right-hand drawer) and the Cards
  // category. The Backgrounds and Tables categories are measured on their own mockups by
  // ShopBackgroundsLayout (20) and ShopTablesLayout (21); ShopCustomizer assembles all three.
  //
  // Art: the shared kit and the ShopUI batch (ArtSource/Working/ShopUI/notes.md, rects from its
  // section 1 and 2): the carousel panel is the plain kit card (slice unit 2.065 = sliceScale
  // 0.898), the tiles the light card (unit 2.66 = 1.157), the selected outline the thin kit line
  // (unit 2.92 = 1.27); the drawer, its discs and icons and the coin are the batch's pieces; the
  // drawer's divider is the title divider's diamond and line. The tiles, pictures and labels below
  // are measurement sources: ShopCustomizer turns each category's tile 0 into that category's tile
  // template and lays the carousel out from the three measured tiles. The track and its thumb are
  // drawn pills in the mockup's colours.
  "name": "Shop",
  "mockup": "15-card-styles.png",
